  m_text: "Multiplayer Rules:\nTap Multiplayer and select a game mode.\n\nCompetition:\n1.
    One player can Host a game and share the room code with friends. \n2. Tap and
    hold the room code to automatically copy it. \n3. Other players select Join and
    tap the code input field to automatically paste the copied code.\n4. Join the
    room and play together.\n\nInternational:\n1. Select your preferred difficulty.
    \n2. Search for and match with players from around the world. \n3. Play together
    on the same Sudoku board.\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 13d3a8943f5180946a35d096fa25312b, type: 2}
