  m_text: "Sudoku Rules: \n\n1. Fill the 9\xD79 grid with numbers 1\u20139.\n2. Each
    row must contain 1\u20139 without repetition.\n3. Each column must contain 1\u20139
    without repetition.\n4. Each 3\xD73 box must contain 1\u20139 without repetition.\n5.
    Use the given numbers as fixed clues.\n6. Complete the entire board correctly
    to win.\n7. Avoid incorrect entries; mistakes may cost lives/hearts.\n"
